f = e^(1/z)
   Laurent series (terms to w^6): 1/z + 1/2/z^2 + 1/6/z^3 + 1/24/z^4 + 1/120/z^5 + 1/720/z^6 + 1
   coefficient of 1/z (residue): 1
f = z^2*e^(1/z)
   Laurent series (terms to w^6): z^2 + z + 1/6/z + 1/24/z^2 + 1/120/z^3 + 1/720/z^4 + 1/2
   coefficient of 1/z (residue): 1/6
warning: Sage's exp(1/z).residue(z == 0) returns 0 (wrong; the series above shows 1)
